MarketBackwardInference.OutputFormat:
You must respond with a valid JSON object having this structure:
{
  "strategy updates": [
    {
      "level": "belief", // Must be one of: "belief", "intent", "emotion" (never "action")
      "decision type": "CREATE",
      "content": "When environmental states indicate X, the market belief is more likely to be Y because..."
    },
    {
      "level": "intent", // Must be one of: "belief", "intent", "emotion" (never "action")
      "decision type": "MODIFY",
      "original id": "intent 20250723155015 0001", // ONLY include this if you know the exact ID; DO NOT guess or make up IDs
      "content": "When the market belief is A, the resulting intention should be B, considering..."
    }
  ]
}
